# comment-hash-literal

## Input

```
path /tmp/file#1
key  val#ue

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..29
  ENTRY@0..17
    WORD_KEY@0..4
      WORD@0..4 "path"
    SPACE@4..5 " "
    LINE_STRING@5..16
      STRING@5..16 "/tmp/file#1"
    NEWLINE@16..17 "\n"
  ENTRY@17..29
    WORD_KEY@17..20
      WORD@17..20 "key"
    SPACE@20..22 "  "
    LINE_STRING@22..28
      STRING@22..28 "val#ue"
    NEWLINE@28..29 "\n"
```

